@startuml
title Smart Housing Services - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Resident" as Resident
actor "Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
actor "Service Staff" as Staff

rectangle "Smart Housing Services" {
  usecase "Sign in" as SignIn
  usecase "Submit a request" as Submit
  usecase "View own requests\nand statuses" as ViewOwn

  usecase "Review requests and\nsystem recommendations" as Review
  usecase "Confirm or correct category\nand service assignment" as Assign
  usecase "Handle requests requiring\nmanual review" as ManualReview
  usecase "View request history" as History
  usecase "Filter requests by\nstatus and category" as Filter

  usecase "View requests assigned\nto own service" as ViewAssigned
  usecase "Update request status" as Update
  usecase "Record resolution note" as Resolution
}

Resident --> SignIn
Resident --> Submit
Resident --> ViewOwn

Dispatcher --> SignIn
Dispatcher --> Review
Dispatcher --> Assign
Dispatcher --> ManualReview
Dispatcher --> History
Dispatcher --> Filter

Staff --> SignIn
Staff --> ViewAssigned
Staff --> Update
Staff --> Resolution

note bottom of Assign
  Assignment requires dispatcher confirmation.
  Category and service recommendations
  are generated internally by the system.
end note

note bottom of Update
  Assigned -> In progress -> Resolved.
  Resolving a request requires a resolution note.
  Staff can update only their service's requests.
end note

@enduml
